{"3969810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galactic Pit Stop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3969810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969810/extras/deb33f40f7eca9e5761e2b5539850777.poster.avif?t=1782208708\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969810/extras/deb33f40f7eca9e5761e2b5539850777.webm?t=1782208708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969810/extras/deb33f40f7eca9e5761e2b5539850777.mp4?t=1782208708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  On the edge of known space, every ship needs one last fill-up before the long dark — and yours is the only station for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   light-years. Run the busiest pit stop on the frontier, alone or with up to 3 friends in online co-op, and grow it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  from a lonely outpost into a thriving interstellar hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969810/extras/973621a1d8d0f52723396fd7f5b1d99e.poster.avif?t=1782208708\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969810/extras/973621a1d8d0f52723396fd7f5b1d99e.webm?t=1782208708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969810/extras/973621a1d8d0f52723396fd7f5b1d99e.mp4?t=1782208708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Shi